  "steps": [
    "Soak overnight and boil the black chana without salt and keep it aside.",
    "Now chop the snake gourd into bite pieces and steam it for 4 to 5 mins.",
    "Now heat oil in a pan.",
    "Add mustard seeds, urad daal, dry chilli, green chilli.",
    "Saute in medium flame until urad daal starts to change colour.",
    "Now add curry leaves and onion.",
    "Keep the flame high and sauté for 3 to 4 mins.",
    "Now keep the flame low and add turmeric powder, red chilli powder, salt.",
    "Saute it in medium flame for a min and add steamed snake gourd and boiled chana along with some water.",
    "Saute in high heat for 3 to 4 mins until gets dry.",
    "Now add grated coconuts and coriander leaves.",
    "Switch off the flame and mix it all well for 1 min.",
    "Now squeeze lemon on top of it, split it and enjoy it !!!"
  ],
